    Fix .mvn path filter in site build workflow (#8174)
    
    The trigger path `.mvn` only matches a file with exactly that name. The
    Maven wrapper configuration lives in files below `.mvn/`, so changes to
    it never triggered the site build. Use `.mvn/**` like the main build
    workflow does.
    
